and this time around it’s Toy meets Tech. Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang’s jobs get exponentially harder when they go head to head with this all-new threat to playtime.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The toys are back in Disney and Pixar’s “Toy Story 5,” and this time around it’s Toy meets Tech. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000009\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-19\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":102,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RFm6wN7IhtY\",\"displayPriority\":3,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002721\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002933\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004242\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009613\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000010641\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017418\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000017419\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"7850\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000222\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002742\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000004\",\"0000000006\",\"0000000010\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"e4e53d03-846a-4c4b-a95f-af4af0f815b4\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008218\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009312\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"WALT DISNEY STUDIOS INTERNTL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008744\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Obsession\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"After breaking the mysterious “One Wish Willow” to win his crush’s heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"After breaking the mysterious “One Wish Willow” to win his crush’s heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence, gore\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-05-15\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fWLaCC8L6Jo\",\"displayPriority\":10,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000002047\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000006579\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018515\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018516\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018517\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018518\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018519\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018520\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018521\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a6a25d26-497a-4daa-a5ff-b5fc9719faca\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008744\",\"hoCode\":\"A000009874\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"UNIVERSAL PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00008964\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Evil Dead Burn\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Evil Dead Burn unleashes the franchise’s most savage and terrifying ride to date, blazing onto big screens with an all-new chapter of carnage and demonic mayhem. After the loss of her husband, a woman seeks solace with her in-laws in their secluded family home. As one by one they are transformed into Deadites—turning the gathering into a family reunion from hell—she comes to discover that the vows she took in life... live on even in death.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Evil Dead Burn unleashes the franchise’s most savage and terrifying ride to date, blazing onto big screens with an all-new chapter of carnage and demonic mayhem. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong bloody violence, gore\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-09\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":109,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YYkUkyfjUKg\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000008177\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000009258\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019021\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019022\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019023\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019024\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000303\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000014\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"3c50ff95-67b2-4152-9965-ad2431794116\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008964\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010114\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"STUDIOCANAL\"},{\"id\":\"HO00009060\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"LE SSERAFIM VR CONCERT: INVITATION\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The moment the elevator doors open, you’re standing in the same space as “LE SSERAFIM.”\\r\\nJust when you think your eyes have met — they vanish. \\r\\nAll that remains is a single, mysterious ‘Frame Card.’\\r\\nBeyond it, another world begins to unfold.\\r\\n\\r\\nInside a food truck where ingredients are flying through the air, you complete your very own SPAGHETTI, \\r\\nand the moment you Come Over at the crossroads of a city where the murals come alive,\\r\\nyou finally land on a strange planet — facing the burning heart of ANTIFRAGILE at its center.\\r\\n\\r\\nAt the boundary where reality and fantasy intersect, an explosion of non-stop energy!\\r\\nLE SSERAFIM presents a new dimension of VR concert fueled by electrifying energy.\\r\\n\\r\\n〈LE SSERAFIM VR CONCERT : INVITATION〉 Now, we invite you to that world.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The moment the elevator doors open, you’re standing in the same space as “LE SSERAFIM.” Just when you think your eyes have met — they vanish. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":60,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019351\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000052\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00009060\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010217\",\"eventId\":\"0000000001\",\"distributorName\":\"AmazeVR, Inc\"},{\"id\":\"HO00009072\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"The Invite\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \\nHave they reignited the spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Joe and Angela’s marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic \\nupstairs neighbors for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"very strong language, strong sex references, drug misuse\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-03\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":106,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7YIHRhRMn94\",\"displayPriority\":8,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000785\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000004368\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019329\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019330\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000241\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001028\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00001154\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002297\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a87bd21e-c69e-4d0b-b7d0-18dabf2eeb9f\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00009072\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010230\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"Black Bear Pictures\"},{\"id\":\"HO00009089\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"Dear You (Teochew with CH/EN subtitles)\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"For years, Grandma Shurou from Chaoshan lived on the letters and remittances from her husband who left for Nanyang to survive the war and never returned. When her debt-ridden grandson Xiaowei secretly travels to Thailand to find his rumoured “millionaire” grandpa, he returns with shocking news: his grandpa is long gone, and the person Grandma had exchanged letters with for years was a stranger. As Xiaowei digs deeper, a long-buried misunderstanding spanning three generations begins to unravel, revealing a truth that binds two families across borders and time.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"For years, Grandma Shurou from Chaoshan lived on the letters and remittances from her husband who left for Nanyang to survive the war and never returned.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong language, violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-06-26\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":118,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qIjOCYltUqA\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019352\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019353\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019354\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019355\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019356\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019357\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019358\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\",\"0000000053\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"fdea5aba-8ee5-45d5-9962-39c2b5f62b31\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00009089\