s next film, The Odyssey, is a mythic action epic shot across the world using brand new IMAX® film technology. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000002\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-17\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":173,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sk6LZrA2JSQ\",\"displayPriority\":4,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000008\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000150\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000155\",\"roles\":[\"Director\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000018948\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000018\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000064\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000267\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000805\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00002248\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000009\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"b63dbbaf-6c0e-4622-b9b1-698037e6247e\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008916\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010058\",\"eventId\":null,\"distributorName\":\"UNIVERSAL PICTURES\"},{\"id\":\"HO00009060\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"LE SSERAFIM VR CONCERT: INVITATION\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"The moment the elevator doors open, you’re standing in the same space as “LE SSERAFIM.”\\r\\nJust when you think your eyes have met — they vanish. \\r\\nAll that remains is a single, mysterious ‘Frame Card.’\\r\\nBeyond it, another world begins to unfold.\\r\\n\\r\\nInside a food truck where ingredients are flying through the air, you complete your very own SPAGHETTI, \\r\\nand the moment you Come Over at the crossroads of a city where the murals come alive,\\r\\nyou finally land on a strange planet — facing the burning heart of ANTIFRAGILE at its center.\\r\\n\\r\\nAt the boundary where reality and fantasy intersect, an explosion of non-stop energy!\\r\\nLE SSERAFIM presents a new dimension of VR concert fueled by electrifying energy.\\r\\n\\r\\n〈LE SSERAFIM VR CONCERT : INVITATION〉 Now, we invite you to that world.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"The moment the elevator doors open, you’re standing in the same space as “LE SSERAFIM.” Just when you think your eyes have met — they vanish. \",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000001\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-07-10\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":60,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000019351\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000052\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":null,\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00009060\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010217\",\"eventId\":\"0000000001\",\"distributorName\":\"AmazeVR, Inc\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000000008\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Lupita\",\"familyName\":\"Nyong'o\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000000150\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Robert\",\"familyName\":\"Pattinson\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000000155\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Christopher\",\"familyName\":\"Nolan\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000018948\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Emma\",\"familyName\":\"Nolan\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000018\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Charlize\",\"familyName\":\"Theron\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000064\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Matt\",\"familyName\":\"Damon\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000267\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Tom \",\"familyName\":\"Holland\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00000805\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Anne\",\"familyName\":\"Hathaway\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"HO00002248\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Zendaya\",\"familyName\":\"\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000019351\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"KIM CHAEWON, SAKURA, HUH \",\"familyName\":\"YUNJIN, KAZUHA, HONG EUNCHAE\",\"middleName\":null}}],\"genres\":[{\"id\"